  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nYour entire life, you've been told you're deathly allergic to bees. You've always had people protecting you from them, be it your mother or a hired hand. Today, one slips through and lands on your shoulder. You hear a tiny voice say \"Your Majesty, what are your orders?\"\n\n\"My orders are for you to not give my identity away. I said please don't speak with me in public like this.\" \n\n\"Yes, Your Majesty.\" said the bee. \"Meet me in my room in ten minutes.\" you said. \nYou arrive at the room, and the bee is waiting for you. Humans always told you that you were allergic to bees. How could you be allergic to your own kind though. The humans didn't know that you were acting as a spy bee for your bee kingdom because only you would be happy to learn the truth of what you needed to discover about humans. \n\n\"So, what is it that you need me to do?\"",
